    "body": "> It seems that `template` having these inconsistencies compared to `div` is bad and a hazard that can cause bugs on sites, and it seems that we should make `template` behave consistently with `div` here.\n\nAgreed, this kind of thing has been exploited as mutation-XSS previously. https://www.acunetix.com/blog/web-security-zone/mutation-xss-in-google-search/",
