    "body": "> [@zcorpan](https://github.com/zcorpan) would you mind taking a look at https://crrev.com/c/7667359 and giving it a review, to see if it meets your needs here? (Also sorry this took a while to get to.)\n\nThe use counters have landed, but they'll take a while to populate. (Likely ~2 months or so for reliable numbers.) But eventually they'll show up here:\n\n- [template](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5857)\n- [iframe](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5858)\n- [XHR](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5859)\n- [DOMParser](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5860)\n- [NoBrowsingContext](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5861)\n\nI likely won't be re-checking these on my own, so feel free to ping me if you notice any issues.",
